    "permission": "Seymour Duncan encourages sharing its wiring diagrams freely; commercial use requires prior written permission. LIMITATIONS: Generic series humbuckers omit lead colors, polarity, electrical values, bridge ground, cable, and load. The source's bridge ground enters the grounded casing network; this model has no bridge terminal. Pots use logical lugs and a 500 kOhm linear teaching scale, not audio taper. The analyzer supports one tone/capacitor branch, so this two-tone estimate is unavailable."
